{"file": "荒岛我为王，女神靠边站-第58集.mp4", "ep": 58, "duration": 102.1, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.0, "text": "周婷,你走一趟"}, {"start": 2.0, "end": 3.0, "text": "請林峰下來"}, {"start": 3.0, "end": 4.0, "text": "請他?"}, {"start": 5.42, "end": 7.42, "text": "就說我道歉"}, {"start": 7.42, "end": 9.42, "text": "威威姐,真道歉啊"}, {"start": 9.42, "end": 10.64, "text": "嗯"}, {"start": 10.64, "end": 11.64, "text": "快去"}, {"start": 11.64, "end": 14.09, "text": "我...我沒聽錯吧"}, {"start": 14.09, "end": 15.09, "text": "錯不了"}, {"start": 15.09, "end": 16.09, "text": "他剛說了個請字"}, {"start": 16.09, "end": 18.09, "text": "真是太陽打溪便出來了"}, {"start": 18.09, "end": 20.09, "text": "蘇威威要去道歉"}, {"start": 20.09, "end": 21.22, "text": "嗯"}, {"start": 21.22, "end": 22.22, "text": "這下子"}, {"start": 22.22, "end": 23.22, "text": "有好戲看了"}, {"start": 23.22, "end": 29.72, "text": "你先看看他"}, {"start": 29.72, "end": 30.82, "text": "先道歉"}, {"start": 30.82, "end": 31.82, "text": "我的藥"}, {"start": 31.82, "end": 32.82, "text": "蓋個舌杖"}, {"start": 32.82, "end": 36.06, "text": "都聽著"}, {"start": 36.06, "end": 37.25, "text": "我"}, {"start": 37.25, "end": 38.25, "text": "蘇威威"}, {"start": 38.25, "end": 40.25, "text": "今天當眾向林峰道歉"}, {"start": 40.25, "end": 42.25, "text": "讓他當免費勞動力的"}, {"start": 42.25, "end": 43.25, "text": "是我"}, {"start": 43.25, "end": 44.28, "text": "說他是安全隱悍的"}, {"start": 44.28, "end": 45.28, "text": "是我"}, {"start": 45.28, "end": 46.28, "text": "發起投票的"}, {"start": 46.28, "end": 47.28, "text": "還是我"}, {"start": 47.28, "end": 49.86, "text": "是我做錯了"}, {"start": 49.86, "end": 51.86, "text": "林峰,對不起"}, {"start": 51.86, "end": 52.86, "text": "看"}, {"start": 52.86, "end": 53.86, "text": "承認自己的錯誤"}, {"start": 53.86, "end": 54.86, "text": "也沒有多難"}, {"start": 54.86, "end": 59.13, "text": "三碗煎成一碗"}, {"start": 59.13, "end": 60.13, "text": "喝三頓"}, {"start": 60.13, "end": 61.13, "text": "保管藥到冰塗"}, {"start": 61.13, "end": 65.78, "text": "這是負贈的"}, {"start": 65.78, "end": 66.78, "text": "我還是那句話"}, {"start": 66.78, "end": 67.78, "text": "我林峰"}, {"start": 67.78, "end": 69.78, "text": "不是一個心思狹隘的人"}, {"start": 69.78, "end": 71.07, "text": "我要的"}, {"start": 71.07, "end": 73.07, "text": "只是公平公正而已"}, {"start": 73.07, "end": 74.07, "text": "要我給了"}, {"start": 74.07, "end": 75.07, "text": "剩下的"}, {"start": 75.07, "end": 76.07, "text": "看你們自己"}, {"start": 76.07, "end": 77.58, "text": "居然真的給了"}, {"start": 77.58, "end": 78.58, "text": "我感覺"}, {"start": 78.58, "end": 80.58, "text": "林峰也不是那麼難相處"}, {"start": 80.58, "end": 81.58, "text": "要不是蘇威威"}, {"start": 81.58, "end": 82.58, "text": "咱們也不至於"}, {"start": 82.58, "end": 83.58, "text": "走到今天這一步"}, {"start": 83.58, "end": 84.58, "text": "快,燒水去"}, {"start": 84.58, "end": 85.58, "text": "按林峰說的"}, {"start": 85.58, "end": 86.58, "text": "三碗煎成一碗"}, {"start": 87.74, "end": 88.74, "text": "程瑤姐"}, {"start": 88.74, "end": 89.74, "text": "你再撐一下"}, {"start": 89.74, "end": 90.74, "text": "要馬上就好了"}]}